6 — Calendar Hooks

For each bullet with date + location, generate an .ics fragment:

BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:[md5(title+date+location)]@digest
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250621T140000
SUMMARY:Event Name
LOCATION:Venue
DESCRIPTION:[Newsletter Title]
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR

Encode as data:text/calendar;base64,… and link with
<a href="ENCODED_URI">📅 Add to calendar</a>.

